{"script":"sj_029_03","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara029_1","mirrow":false,"x":290,"trans":true,"y":-258,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1d","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara029_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":290,"trans":true,"y":-258,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1d","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]啊，是的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]我听说你之前是从附近的一个遗迹摔落下来的，我想找找看能不能到达那里。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]很遗憾，我在探查过之后也得到了和你相同的结论。那个遗迹坐落在一个悬崖边上，应该没办法找到上去的路。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]你问我为什么对遗迹感兴趣？你应该知道，我一直在做灾害的研究吧？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]冗长的理论知识我就不跟你讲了。从结论来说，自然灾害的本质就是大陆的元素流——地脉发生了异常。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]而据我观察，很多先时遗迹都建立在地脉节点上。我一直在追寻导致灾害的地脉异常之间的规律，并研究预防和消弭灾难的方法。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]你问……为什么这么执着对灾害的研究？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]那我问你。之前你们被角布林侵害过的营地，它还回得来吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]即使营地能被重建，心中的伤痕也是无法被治愈的。每一次灾害，都是一道刻在遗民心中深厚的伤。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]如果……我真的能做到预测阻止每一次灾害……说不定就有资格在这样安稳的营地里，彻底放松下去了吧……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"安娜","text":"[show]啊，不好意思，扯远了。这其中的故事，等我们有机会再细细说明吧。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara029_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":290,"trans":true,"y":-258,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara029_1_face_chara029_1b","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"sj_029-你刚才出门了？"}